  "notes": "{参考|さんこう} means consulting information for guidance. It is used both as a noun and with する as a verb.\n\nKEY PATTERNS:\n- {参考|さんこう}にする: to use as reference, to take into account\n- {参考|さんこう}になる: to be helpful, to be informative\n- ご{参考|さんこう}までに: for your reference (polite, common in business)\n\nCOMMON COMPOUNDS:\n- {参考|さんこう}{書|しょ}: reference book\n- {参考|さんこう}{文献|ぶんけん}: bibliography, references\n- {参考|さんこう}{資料|しりょう}: reference materials\n- {参考|さんこう}{価格|かかく}: reference price\n\nREGISTER:\nWide usage from casual to formal. The polite prefix ご{参考|さんこう} is standard in business email and presentations.",
